{"id":"n39941-1-2","stage":4,"title":"금전 · 金币","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n39941-1-2-1","ko":"이 동전은 왜 색깔이 누래요?","zh":"这枚硬币为什么是黄色的呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동전은","meaning":"硬币","explanation":"동전：硬币；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"동전","audio":"/audio/cde4842b8ab41342df40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48655","senseId":"1","lemma":"동전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"색깔이","meaning":"颜色，色彩","explanation":"색깔：颜色，色彩；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"색깔","audio":"/audio/3d409d9195a629032477.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57307","senseId":"1","lemma":"색깔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"누래요?","meaning":"深黄，暗黄","explanation":"누렇다：深黄，暗黄；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"누렇다","audio":"/audio/daf86a8ec746539df1b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"45598","senseId":"1","lemma":"누렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"cde4842b8ab41342","term":"동전","zh":"硬币","audio":"/audio/cde4842b8ab41342df40.mp3","entryId":"48655","definition":"用铜等金属制成的圆形货币。","pronunciation":["동전"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"3d409d9195a62903","term":"색깔","zh":"颜色，色彩","audio":"/audio/3d409d9195a629032477.mp3","entryId":"57307","definition":"物体在光照下显出的