f9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/99e641b9a84232d36177.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.009,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=39941","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":143,"sequenceScore":2.8357,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这枚硬币为什么是黄色的呢？","因为这是用黄金制成的硬币啊。","好像楼下的房子着火啦！"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这枚硬币为什么是黄色的呢？","因为这是用黄金制成的硬币啊。","好像楼下的房子着火啦！"],"answer":1}]}
